<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo sets 150 mln mark rex-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo sets 150 mln mark rex-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.00	MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    DUSSELDORF</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN COUPON LINKED THE REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>		SUBINDEX TIMES 81 PCT.</p>
<p>		OFFENLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 685</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
